            # Our parse_and_or/simple command consumes arguments greedily, so e.g. 'fi' after command without sep was consumed as arg.
            # However for compounds ending with } or ) or ']]' etc, next keyword could follow directly without sep: "{ echo; }fi" ? } consumed, fi is just after.
            # Continue.
